  "scope": "Finite generalization of the existing dense output-major F32-result projection contract; no parallel Qwen-specific operation or executor.",
  "contract": "Plain dense F16/BF16/F32 A and W; positive rank2 or exact same-batch rank3; F32 products, accumulation and output; preserve original input precision, no full F32 weight bank.",
  "providers": {
    "ggml_cuda": "All 9 input dtype pairs actually tested at rank2. Existing BF16/BF16 path unchanged. F32 or mixed inputs use the original native batched matvec, widening only a non-F32 activation. Paired K even, B/M <=65535, batched original W N<=512; unsupported odd K/geometry declines rather than falling through to full-W conversion.",
    "cublas": "Same input dtype F16/F16, BF16/BF16, F32/F32 -> F32, native stored-weight descriptor with exact batch axes. Mixed inputs explicitly decline. Odd K5 and rank3 executed. F32 uses original PEDANTIC arithmetic, 16bit uses original F32 accumulation policy."
  },
