      "Independent rank3 batch weights and stored output-major orientation",
      "Original F32 W and A low bits preserved",
      "All 9 floating dtype pairs checked against independent decoded dyadic oracle",
      "Full-vocabulary 248320x2048 F16 weight cold preparation below quarter-bank workspace (no huge allocation/submit)",
      "Odd native MMVF domain honestly rejected; cuBLAS same-type odd-K actual execution",
      "Ordinary MatMul dtype contract unchanged"
    ]
  },
